		{
			dependencies: ["04637BD27BD58F51"]
			description: [
				"Perfect, your first hammer."
				""
				"All of GregTech's tools can be made from many different materials. Each one provides more or less durablity, so it is worth browsing to find the best one for your level. "
				""
				"These tools are not consumed when crafted with, instead they take durablity damage. Your first hammer can be iron, or wrought iron if you are a high achiever. It is generally a good idea to make tools out of the best material you can, as they will last much longer"
				""
				"PS: GregTech tools can be repaired in an anvil. Your hammer can also mute machines if you right-click them."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "gtceu:iron_hammer"
