		{
			dependencies: ["12D6698F3F2B80B7"]
			description: [
				"Feeling thirsty?"
				""
				"The bucket recipe may not be what you expected. It now requires plates. Plates can be made with two ingots and the new hammer you just made. This ratio does get better with time. For now, take note of how this basic recipe has been changed, there are many more around the corner. "
				""
				"Take this &6Wooden Barrel&r full of &bWater&r as a reward. Its portable atleast."
			]
			id: "17DF87A40EA9ADEC"
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.5d
			subtitle: "Thats one way to use a plate"
			tasks: [{
				id: "76C330D4EDA1F0C9"
				item: "minecraft:bucket"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "I NEED WATER!"
			x: 3.0d
			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["12D6698F3F2B80B7"]
			description: [
				"More GregTech tools are required for progression - here are the ones to lay eyes on."
				""
				"&9&lWrench:&r A crafting tool, but also the correct tool for GregTech machines... perfect if you think using pickaxes is unethical. It can also double as a &6wrench for other mods&r. Right-click allows you to set the output side of GregTech machines, and sneak-right-clicking rotates machines."
				""
				"&9&lFile:&r A crafting tool... and that's it. Yay!"
				""
				"&9&lSaw:&r Yet another crafting tool. If we were any more evil, we would force its use if you wanted to obtain 4 Planks and 4 Sticks from their respective crafting recipes. That being said, you can still use it to get &a6 Planks per Log&r, if you wish."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&eNote:&r Any Quest with GregTech tools can be completed with the tool crafted from any material, not just the one displayed."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "gtceu:tungsten_steel_wrench"
